# Secrets — never commit a real key.
# The plugin reads config.json from the directory next to gimp-ai-plugin.py
# (see gimp-ai-plugin.py:82), so anyone running it from a checkout will have a
# live key sitting in the working tree. Only config.json.example is tracked.
config.json
.env
*.key
